# Generated single-file build of cymatic.html (node faraday/build-standalone.mjs),
# where that command writes it by default: at the repository root. ANCHORED with a
# leading slash, and that is load bearing. It used to be ignored by bare name,
# which matches at any depth -- so when the bundle began to be committed, the copy
# of this same page inside faraday-cell/ would have been silently skipped by
# `git add`, and the folder people download would have arrived without the one
# file they are told to double-click.
/faraday-cell-standalone.html

# faraday-cell/ and faraday-cell.zip are NOT ignored: they are committed, so the
# simulation can be downloaded from the repository as one folder or one file.
# They are build outputs (node faraday/build-zip.mjs), and a committed build output
# is acceptable exactly when something fails the moment it stops matching its
# source -- faraday/check-bundle.mjs, in CI, requires both to be byte for byte
# what the sources build today.
